# tracker.event.v0
#
# Runtime owner: Loop tracker realization.
# Law realized: premath.issue-transition.v0.
#
# File layout:
#   ${BOAT_TRACKER_ROOT}/events.jsonl
#
# Each non-empty line is a JSON object with these required fields:
#   seq              global event-log sequence, starting at 0
#   issue_seq        per-issue event sequence, starting at 0 for that issue
#   prev_hash        ZERO for global genesis, else previous global row hash
#   issue_prev_hash  ZERO for issue genesis, else previous same-issue row hash
#   ts               timestamp token; wall-clock truth is not checked in v0
#   actor            identity.presentation:* reference
#   issue            IssueId
#   from             unborn | open | claimed | closed | obstructed
#   to               open | claimed | closed | obstructed
#   reason           formed transition reason ref
#   claimed_classes  declared witness classes recorded at append time
#   hash             sha256 over canonical JSON excluding hash
#
# The executable checker is:
#   BOAT_TRACKER_ROOT=<scratch-or-store> tools/tracker.sh verify
#
# The log is rewritten through a temp file, fsynced, then renamed while a
# tracker-root mkdir lock is held. Prior rows are copied byte-for-byte.
